   <description>
      <short>
         <en>Geolocation is a GLPI plugin that adds geographic coordinates to your Tickets and Assets</en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>The Geolocation plugin extends GLPI by integrating spatial coordinates into ITIL Objects (Tickets) and CommonDBTM (Assets). It provides an interactive, editable map for every record, allowing technicians to fine-tune location data for precise dispatching and asset tracking.</en>
      </long>
   </description>
